SUMMARY:Smorgasbord (ft. Board Games and Dancing)
DESCRIPTION:We are building an exciting community event unlike any other! It’s a little bit board games\, a little bit family dance party\, a little bit dance lessons\, and a lot of what you want to help us make it! So\, what were we going to call it other than Smorgasbord? \nHere’s what we know so far: \n\nBoard Games downstairs\nDancing upstairs\nDance Lessons upstairs ($10 per person)\n\nThe event is FREE\, but we are renting the space\, so donations to help us cover costs are encouraged. \nWe will have a selection of family friendly board games on hand. Feel free to bring your own as well. \nDance Lessons will be taught by Brian Gardner\, who founded Swing Goth in 2007 and was recognized as Best of the Bay by SF Guardian and hosted events that were featured in SF Weekly\, SF Chronicle\, Oakland Tribune\, 7×7 Magazine and even New York Times and New York Post!
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/smorgasbord-ft-board-games-and-dancing/2026-05-20/
LOCATION:Kinton Grange\, 19015 SW Scholls Ferry Rd\, Beaverton\, OR 97007\, OR\, 97007\, United States
CATEGORIES:Dance,Family Fun,Gaming,Inclusive,Indoor,Kids Calendar,LGBTQ+,Music,Playgroup,Pride
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Smorgasbord.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Smorgasbord":MAILTO:brigar@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
